on of specific mRNAs most likely by mediating their endosomal transport. The complex recruits mRNAs and ribosomes to early endosomes through direct mRNA-interaction (PubMed:37267905). In the complex, PPP1R21 serves as a binding hub connecting all five complex subunits and mediating the binding to mRNA and early endosomes via RAB5A (PubMed:37267906). Putative regulator of protein phosphatase 1 (PP1) activity (PubMed:19389623). May play a role in the endosomal sorting process or in endosome maturation pathway (Probable) (PubMed:30520571)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}